#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000000
msgid "This is HQ."
msgstr "总部。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000001
msgid "Understood. Dispatching reinforcements now."
msgstr "了解。正在派遣增援。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000002
msgid "Negative. We can't spare reinforcements. You'll have to make do with what you have."
msgstr "不行。我们抽不出增援。你只能靠现有兵力应付。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000003
msgid "Understood. Eliminate all hostiles."
msgstr "了解。消灭所有敌人。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000004
msgid "Understood. Dispatching reinforcements. Proceed with extra caution."
msgstr "了解。正在派遣增援。请格外小心行事。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000005
msgid "Understood. Maintain heightened alert."
msgstr "了解。保持高度警戒。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000006
msgid "Understood. The enemy should still be nearby. Find him."
msgstr "了解。敌人应该还在附近。找到他。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000008
msgid "We have a situation. Backup team, head over and investigate."
msgstr "出现状况。后备队，过去调查。"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000009
msgid "What's going on over there?"
msgstr "那边发生了什么？"

#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x00000a
